ilding capacity for future growth.","It has beaten earnings estimates by 38.2% on average.","Analysts expect 18.5% long-term annual earnings growth."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.3%), and institutions hold 88%.","Insider trading is two-way: 2 purchases and 1 sale over the past year, net $283K sold."],"people":["With about 9,400 employees, each generates about $399K of revenue, in line with the Industrials median.","That works out to $10K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.8M (7x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better)."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":62,"head":"Watch: trades 13% above fair value of $67.52.","pros":["ROIC 21.3% vs WACC 10.5%","Revenue grew 31.5%/yr over 3y","Net debt/EBITDA 1.0x","Altman Z in the safe zone","P/E 13.6x vs sector 23.3x"],"cons":["Trades 13% above fair value of $67.52","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/FCF 43.5x vs sector 22.3x","Flag: thin EDGAR history (4y)"],"flags":[],"need":["the model rates it HOLD","no margin of safety","the fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)"],"buy_below":57.39,"vc":{"base":67.52,"base_src":"dcf","bear":36.83,"bull":122.84,"alt_median":97.69,"n_alt":2,"gap":-0.3089,"dispersion":0.0319,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","bull case is 3.3x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":23.2692,"ev_ebitda":13.319,"pfcf":22.2778,"pb":3.0551,"roic":0.1001,"gross_margin":0.2851,"fcf_margin":0.068,"div_yield":0.0147}},"ticker":"ECG","date":"2026-11-06"}